1
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:02,630
When an AI agent decides,

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:06,330
the only record of why is a log its operator controls.

3
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:10,660
Verdict Desk turns each decision into evidence a lawyer can file.

4
00:00:10,790 --> 00:00:13,120
Check one: the verdict is re-derived,

5
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:14,480
not just re-hashed.

6
00:00:14,450 --> 00:00:16,780
The judge rules again from the frozen evidence,

7
00:00:16,750 --> 00:00:19,250
and every verdict comes out the same.

8
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:22,310
Check two: every number an AI analyst states must

9
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:24,190
be in the evidence it cites.

10
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:25,050
When it is not,

11
00:00:25,020 --> 00:00:27,750
the claim is refused and kept with the reason.

12
00:00:27,720 --> 00:00:29,540
So far, hundreds.

13
00:00:29,860 --> 00:00:32,670
Check three: witnesses we do not control.

14
00:00:32,640 --> 00:00:34,630
The head is stamped in Bitcoin,

15
00:00:34,600 --> 00:00:36,730
signed in the public Sigstore log,

16
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:39,400
and anchored on Ethereum Sepolia.

17
00:00:39,380 --> 00:00:41,500
Your browser checks each one.

18
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:45,420
The Chainlink Runtime Environment is the independent auditor.

19
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:48,140
Before it anchors, it replays the verdict itself and

20
00:00:48,110 --> 00:00:50,020
refuses a forged head.

21
00:00:49,990 --> 00:00:53,190
Three thousand of three thousand edits were refused.

22
00:00:53,530 --> 00:00:57,740
Check four: we attack our own verifier and publish the score.

23
00:00:57,710 --> 00:01:00,620
Thousands of attacks, and none got through.

24
00:01:00,590 --> 00:01:01,600
Break the chain yourself,

25
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:03,170
right in the browser.

26
00:01:03,390 --> 00:01:06,200
Check five: a public record that keeps the losing

27
00:01:06,170 --> 00:01:07,840
trades and the gaps.

28
00:01:07,810 --> 00:01:09,020
Verdict Desk.

29
00:01:08,990 --> 00:01:10,420
Check it yourself.

30
00:01:10,390 --> 00:01:11,910
Nothing to install.
